    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d667">

                <pb facs="0794" n="698" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg698"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Storer.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-08-03"><hi rendition="#italic">August 3,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your 33 received. Following names agree with lists here: Cartegena: José R.
                    Nicolas, José de la Rosa, Enrique Dole, José Fonticoba. Ceuta: Carlos Garcia
                    Sierra, Cecilio Garcia Carmenate. Burgos: Antonio Capablanca Fernández, Julian
                    Alvarez Salazar, Norberto Rojas Hernández.</p>
                <p>You will ask their release and return to Cuba, reserving others for further
                    identification.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
